From caf-talk Caf Jan 30 15:44:18 1993
Newsgroups: alt.comp.acad-freedom.talk
From: kadie@eff.org (Carl M. Kadie)
Subject: Legality of campus speech codes
Message-ID: <1993Jan30.204411.20878@eff.org>
